  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Samples VRC Light Volumes and returns SH components and colored
    individual speculars based on simple PBR input.


    NOTE: World Position Offset
    only applies to Light Volumes sampling, not the Point Light Volumes. Useful for
    applying some Bias.'
